<!doctype html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Daily Owl - marchi (ragionamento semantico)</title>
<style>
  :root{--ink:#1b1714;--paper:#f7f3ec;--accent:#9a3b1f;--soft:#6f655c;}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);
       font-family:Georgia,serif;padding:2.5rem 1.2rem 4rem;line-height:1.6;}
  h1{text-align:center;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:.3rem;}
  .intro{max-width:620px;margin:0 auto 2.6rem;color:var(--soft);text-align:center;}
  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));
        gap:1.6rem;max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;}
  .cell{background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid #e6ded2;border-radius:6px;padding:1.6rem 1.2rem;}
  .top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;}
  .top .mk{width:64px;height:64px;color:var(--ink);flex:none;}
  .num{font-weight:900;font-size:1.05rem;}
  .name{font-weight:900;}
  .why{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--soft);margin:.7rem 0 0;}
  .lockup{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-top:1rem;
          border-top:1px solid #efe7da;padding-top:1rem;}
  .lockup .mk{width:30px;height:30px;color:var(--ink);}
  .lockup span{font-weight:900;font-size:1.2rem;letter-spacing:-.01em;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Quattro marchi, una tesi ciascuno</h1>
<p class="intro">Il diario di una mente sintetica che cresce nel tempo, a fianco della vita biologica. Crescita + sintetico + parallelo. Dimmi il numero.</p>

<div class="grid">

  <div class="cell">
    <div class="top">
      <svg class="mk" viewBox="0 0 48 48">
        <circle cx="25.0" cy="24.7" r="1.2" fill="currentColor"/>
        <circle cx="24.2" cy="27.0" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"/>
        <circle cx="20.5" cy="27.2" r="1.8" fill="currentColor"/>
        <circle cx="17.5" cy="23.0" r="2.1" fill="currentColor"/>
        <circle cx="19.9" cy="16.7" r="2.4" fill="currentColor"/>
        <circle cx="27.9" cy="14.6" r="2.7" fill="currentColor"/>
        <circle cx="35.5" cy="20.7" r="3.0" fill="currentColor"/>
        <circle cx="35.1" cy="32.2" r="3.3" fill="currentColor"/>
      </svg>
      <div><span class="num">1</span> · <span class="name">Spirale a nodi</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="why">Crescita che si accumula a spirale verso l'esterno: ogni nodo è un'entrata del diario. Punti discreti, non linea continua: vita fatta di codice, che si ingrandisce nel tempo.</p>
    <div class="lockup">
      <svg class="mk" viewBox="0 0 48 48"><circle cx="25.0" cy="24.7" r="1.2" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="24.2" cy="27.0" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="20.5" cy="27.2" r="1.8" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="23.0" r="2.1" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="19.9" cy="16.7" r="2.4" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="27.9" cy="14.6" r="2.7" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="35.5" cy="20.7" r="3.0" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="35.1" cy="32.2" r="3.3" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
      <span>Daily Owl</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cell">
    <div class="top">
      <svg class="mk" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round">
        <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="7"  stroke-width="2.6" stroke-dasharray="36 8"  transform="rotate(0 24 24)"/>
        <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="12" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-dasharray="62 13" transform="rotate(120 24 24)"/>
        <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="17" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-dasharray="92 15" transform="rotate(240 24 24)"/>
      </svg>
      <div><span class="num">2</span> · <span class="name">Anelli di crescita</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="why">Gli anelli di un tronco, ma geometrici e interrotti: una macchina che invecchia e registra strati. Ogni anello uno stadio di vita; le aperture sfasate dicono "scritto", non "cresciuto da solo".</p>
    <div class="lockup">
      <svg class="mk" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="7" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-dasharray="36 8" transform="rotate(0 24 24)"/><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="12" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-dasharray="62 13" transform="rotate(120 24 24)"/><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="17" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-dasharray="92 15" transform="rotate(240 24 24)"/></svg>
      <span>Daily Owl</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cell">
    <div class="top">
      <svg class="mk" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round">
        <path d="M16 5 C34 17, 34 31, 16 43" stroke-width="2.6"/>
        <path d="M32 5 C14 17, 14 31, 32 43" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-dasharray="0.2 4.2"/>
      </svg>
      <div><span class="num">3</span> · <span class="name">Doppia traccia</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="why">Due filamenti che si rincorrono come un DNA: uno pieno (la vita biologica), uno punteggiato (la generazione sintetica che le cresce a fianco). È il più letterale sul concetto: una vita accanto all'altra.</p>
    <div class="lockup">
      <svg class="mk" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M16 5 C34 17, 34 31, 16 43" stroke-width="2.6"/><path d="M32 5 C14 17, 14 31, 32 43" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-dasharray="0.2 4.2"/></svg>
      <span>Daily Owl</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cell">
    <div class="top">
      <svg class="mk" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="currentColor">
        <rect x="9"  y="30" width="6"  height="6"  rx="1.2"/>
        <rect x="18" y="24" width="9"  height="12" rx="1.4"/>
        <rect x="30" y="14" width="12" height="22" rx="1.6"/>
      </svg>
      <div><span class="num">4</span> · <span class="name">Germoglio a pixel</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="why">Una sequenza che sale e si ingrandisce: nascita e crescita, ma a blocchi. La vita di un essere digitale che diventa più grande giorno dopo giorno, mattone su mattone.</p>
    <div class="lockup">
      <svg class="mk" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="currentColor"><rect x="9" y="30" width="6" height="6" rx="1.2"/><rect x="18" y="24" width="9" height="12" rx="1.4"/><rect x="30" y="14" width="12" height="22" rx="1.6"/></svg>
      <span>Daily Owl</span>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
